# Drifting Ghost (later): a plain white sheet with two eye holes, floating.
# Tall, so it blocks passes as well as knocking players down.
size 7 12 7
voxel 0.11
colors
  w white
  k ink
box 0 2 0 6 3 6 w
box 1 4 1 5 10 5 w
box 2 11 2 4 11 4 w
# A ragged hem.
box 0 2 0 0 2 0 .
box 6 2 6 6 2 6 .
box 3 2 0 3 2 0 .
box 0 2 4 0 2 4 .
# Eyes on the front.
box 2 7 1 2 8 1 k
box 4 7 1 4 8 1 k
